message: "If you use this vocabulary, please cite it as below."
title: "ITPRA ontology"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "4th Try Tech (Michael Lehman)"
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/4thtrytech/itpra-ontology"
url: "https://itpra.4thtry.tech/"
abstract: >-
  The controlled vocabulary of the IT Platform Reference Architecture (ITPRA): service domains, planes, capability
  domains, capabilities, functions, personas, journeys, workflows, dimensions, governance constructs, quality
  attributes and cross-cutting concepts for describing an enterprise IT platform, tool-agnostic and neutral to any
  operating model.
keywords:
  - reference architecture
  - enterprise IT platform
  - controlled vocabulary
  - ontology
  - platform engineering
